{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Asymptotic Equivalence","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>渐近等价 · Asymptotic Equivalence</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>设数列 <span class=\"math inline\">b_n</span> 从某项起不为零。若</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{a_n}{b_n}=1,\n</div>\n<p>称 <span class=\"math inline\">a_n</span> 与 <span class=\"math inline\">b_n</span> <strong>渐近等价（asymptotically equivalent）</strong>，记作 <span class=\"math inline\">a_n\\sim b_n</span>。这里的<a href=\"#/learn/calc.limit?anchor=definition\">极限</a>比较的是相对大小；等价地，<span class=\"math inline\">(a_n-b_n)/b_n\\to0</span>。</p>\n<p>函数的记法相同：在指定的趋近过程中，若 <span class=\"math inline\">g(x)</span> 最终非零且 <span class=\"math inline\">f(x)/g(x)\\to1</span>，就写 <span class=\"math inline\">f(x)\\sim g(x)</span>。</p>\n<p>例如 <span class=\"math inline\">n+1\\sim n</span>，但两者之差恒为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。在<a href=\"#/learn/calc.stirling-formula?articles=calc.stirling-formula.gamma-integral&amp;anchor=stirling-proof\">斯特林公式</a>中，<span class=\"math inline\">n!\\sim\\sqrt{2\\pi n}(n/e)^n</span> 也表示两边的比值趋于 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。</p>\n","id":"calc.asymptotic-equivalence.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.asymptotic-equivalence","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"渐近等价"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Asymptotic Equivalence","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>渐近等价 · Asymptotic Equivalence</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>设数列 <span class=\"math inline\">b_n</span> 从某项起不为零。若</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{a_n}{b_n}=1,\n</div>\n<p>称 <span class=\"math inline\">a_n</span> 与 <span class=\"math inline\">b_n</span> <strong>渐近等价（asymptotically equivalent）</strong>，记作 <span class=\"math inline\">a_n\\sim b_n</span>。这里的<a href=\"#/learn/calc.limit?anchor=definition\">极限</a>比较的是相对大小；等价地，<span class=\"math inline\">(a_n-b_n)/b_n\\to0</span>。</p